<title>USA: St Paul hogs off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul hogs off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts</p>
<p>compared with Wednesday, were $0.50 lower. Top $54.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3	   220-250 lbs 54.00</p>
<p>			 250-260 lbs 53.50-54.00</p>
<p>			 260-270 lbs 52.50-53.50</p>
<p>    US 2-3	   270-280 lbs 51.50-52.50</p>
<p>    US 2-4	   280-290 lbs 50.50-51.50</p>
<p>Sows - steady/off $2.00. Top $50.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3	   300-450 lbs    45.00-46.00</p>
<p>			 450-500 lbs    47.50</p>
<p>			 500-550 lbs    49.00</p>
<p>			 550-700 lbs    50.00</p>
</text>
